{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_845.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"65c73c2ea8b39e9df321607d5e51d19dab94bb34058fe194ecf5286f5ce6facf","ja":"今日から『Jus-2-Mint』のライブツアーやな！\n何公演もあるけど、頑張ってこな！","zh":"从今天开始就是『Jus-2-Mint』的巡演了！虽然有好几场演出，也要加油啊！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_845.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"0669e4a1d2d0c527e5adc690a2d048e833ad535f486183b8b62e0fddad55bc61","ja":"うん！　それと、ライブに合わせて\nSNSにアップする写真も撮らなくちゃだね。","zh":"嗯！还有，为了配合演出，也得拍些要上传到社交媒体的照片才行。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_845.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"e4b5aae881e606514cd4154ccaccbed10ded06def039df29840fd66a7e3cb68d","ja":"あっ、せやった！　●●●●プロデューサーさんに\nお願いされてたんやったな……。","zh":"啊，对了！●●●●制作人之前拜托过我的来着……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_845.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"8b2b5f288ba1b7274434f8f86aada162b31c897e012991f9a6d588dd503d23cc","ja":"SNSってことは……やっぱ『映え』が大切なんかな？\nどういうのがええんやろ……？","zh":"既然是SNS……果然还是“上镜”比较重要吧？\n什么样的才好呢……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_845.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"33c058c61825fb319a80f0bcd4ec6756e832d2c4d32a6713b0198059f473f48e","ja":"うーん、●●●●プロデューサーさんは、\n何気ない日常の写真でもいいって言ってたけど……。","zh":"嗯——●●●●制作人说，哪怕是日常随手拍的照片也可以……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_845.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"1795f9b9a889cb3c827d195a3846ae9898d01ac07c2adf83f774b6594552e57f","ja":"そうだ！　奈緒ちゃんが差し入れてくれた\nたこ焼き、使えるかも！","zh":"对了！奈绪送来的章鱼烧，说不定能派上用场！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_845.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"044ea87f2e143c3da11d48e0885677c9233880ef3a4ae6cbf439e6e0be2ec0bf","ja":"なるほど、たこ焼きか……。せやな、マヨネーズとか\n串とか使って、タコパっぽく盛りつければ……！","zh":"原来如此，是章鱼烧啊……。对哦，用蛋黄酱之类的，再插上竹签，摆得像章鱼烧派对一样……！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_845.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"fae9a3bce07a21b57a290322c6de42cf969b262a2d09a92c9b279b6593f5cd26","ja":"わあ、すっごくいいと思う！\n毎回、差し入れを撮影するっていうのも、アリだよね！","zh":"哇，我觉得特别好！每次都拍下慰问品的照片，也不错吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_845.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"22a958a1aaadb4c72715720c983e6a5eb66bc1ad6e68b9acdea2064d1c162c48","ja":"よし、決まりやな♪　ライブもSNSも、\nこの調子でバッチリ『映え』るで～！","zh":"好，就这么定了♪ 现场演出和SNS也要照这个势头，狠狠“出片”一把～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
